{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（8日）中午12時53分，據報，旺角花園街先達廣場對開，警方截查一輛車，以涉嫌「販毒」拘捕1男1女。警方正在場調查事件。</p><figure><img alt=\"從網上圖片可見，警方圍封一部的士。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184868747853303808756389.jpeg/IVTrEK1uly9J2CsRk9r0SOnuJzvh4MbIxTItuMUyLbg\"/><figcaption>從網上圖片可見，警方圍封一部的士。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方以涉嫌「販毒」拘捕1男1女（左二及右二）。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184868745533722624980257.jpeg/lX41HhRZtb9Oc7rsawa7NGlj6ywbvG2OeQv0fnkL9H4\"/><figcaption>警方以涉嫌「販毒」拘捕1男1女（左二及右二）。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T06:25:50.285103+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}